                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a partition into disjoint dominating sets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfc81476-c19e-470a-a96c-6152684818b0",
                                                "sense_id": "bf1ad245-3b39-3297-8542-190438fef4cd",
                                                "text": "Sleep scheduling is a standard approach for balancing energy consumption, which has been abstracted as the domatic partition problem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5aa06398-76fd-3816-b3d2-317d8f2aff31",
                                        "entry_id": "dd715075-ae00-31a9-b114-cc5c3f487e17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having only one plane of symmetry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "922e49ab-8a35-44e1-bd2a-1028573e2e46",
                                                "sense_id": "5aa06398-76fd-3816-b3d2-317d8f2aff31",
                                                "text": "The microscopically small crystals often obtained by very rapid cooling of the hot solution, appeared to be no crystals of the optically active form either; they were rhombic individuals exhibiting prismatic, domatic and basal facets, of a new hydrate of the racemic compound, probably at higher temperatures stable, and containing less water of crystallization."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "520ed434-5f9e-3a9d-9ae1-e83b1bf37fb8",
                                        "entry_id": "dd715075-ae00-31a9-b114-cc5c3f487e17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of Domatic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26476751-edfe-4dc1-8f20-1adce76c3deb",
                                                "sense_id": "520ed434-5f9e-3a9d-9ae1-e83b1bf37fb8",
                                                "text": "Hence there resulted a division of the membership of the brotherhood into two classes, the practical and theoretic, or, as they are more commonly called, the operative and speculative, or “domatic” and “geomatic.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
